{"session_id": "local-c8cd29c3", "role": "user", "content": "写一首关于清晨的诗", "meta": {}}
{"session_id": "local-c8cd29c3", "role": "agent", "content": "题目：写一首关于清晨的诗\n风把任务轻轻摊开成纸，\n字句沿着目标慢慢成诗。\n若你问此行最终为何物，\n便把答案写进眼前此时。", "meta": {"style": "classic", "source": "poet_agent"}}
{"session_id": "local-63f5d75a", "role": "user", "content": "写一首关于海风的诗", "meta": {}}
{"session_id": "local-f0c5e20c", "role": "user", "content": "12", "meta": {}}
{"session_id": "local-f0c5e20c", "role": "agent", "content": "钟面锈蚀了十二次回旋，  \n雪落在十二月的指间。  \n子夜与正午在刻度上交汇，  \n而时间依然冰冷如弦。", "meta": {"style": "classic", "source": "poet_agent", "provider_meta": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 51, "completion_tokens": 192, "total_tokens": 243, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 154}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 51}}}}
{"session_id": "local-2771831b", "role": "user", "content": "睡觉", "meta": {}}
{"session_id": "local-2771831b", "role": "agent", "content": "睡眠是温柔的潮水  \n漫过意识的堤岸  \n梦的鱼群游弋在  \n合拢的眼睑深处", "meta": {"style": "classic", "source": "poet_agent", "provider_meta": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 51, "completion_tokens": 81, "total_tokens": 132, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 55}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 51}}}}
{"session_id": "local-614c0aa8", "role": "user", "content": "123", "meta": {}}
{"session_id": "local-614c0aa8", "role": "agent", "content": "一，二，三——寂静  \n在第四根弦上  \n断裂。你数着  \n雨滴落进空杯", "meta": {"style": "classic", "source": "poet_agent", "provider_meta": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 51, "completion_tokens": 379, "total_tokens": 430, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 352}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 51}}}}
{"session_id": "local-ccac4bc6", "role": "user", "content": "睡觉", "meta": {}}
{"session_id": "local-ccac4bc6", "role": "agent", "content": "黑暗将你轻轻抱起，  \n像海收起疲倦的云。  \n梦里漂流着一整夜，  \n醒来时枕边有月光。", "meta": {"style": "classic", "source": "poet_agent", "provider_meta": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 51, "completion_tokens": 103, "total_tokens": 154, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 73}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 51}}}}
{"session_id": "local-e19fa288", "role": "user", "content": "睡觉", "meta": {}}
{"session_id": "local-e19fa288", "role": "agent", "content": "床是夜风中的一叶舟，\n梦的鳞片在黑暗中浮游。\n枕边的时间缓缓弯曲，\n我的呼吸，泊在寂静的深喉。", "meta": {"style": "classic", "source": "poet_agent", "provider_meta": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 51, "completion_tokens": 77, "total_tokens": 128, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 42}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 51}}}}
{"session_id": "local-4f88e781", "role": "user", "content": "睡觉", "meta": {}}
{"session_id": "local-4f88e781", "role": "agent", "content": "枕边浮起月光的潮  \n呼吸化作青瓷的薄雾  \n睫毛轻掩，黑暗里  \n梦的根须悄悄生长", "meta": {"style": "classic", "source": "poet_agent", "provider_meta": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 51, "completion_tokens": 149, "total_tokens": 200, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 119}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 51}}}}
